<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Copenhagen Guide: 14 places – harbour bath, spiral tower, CopenHill, Tivoli &amp; street food – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Nyhavn</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>12.59089,55.67974,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Church of Our Saviour</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · The last steps are narrow and slippery in wind. Shortly before sunset it was not crowded. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>12.59425,55.67291,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Torvehallerne</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>12.56955,55.68387,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Tivoli Gardens</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come in the evening when the lights come on. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>12.56918,55.67342,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. The Little Mermaid &amp; Kastellet</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Combine the statue with a walk through Kastellet. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>12.59929,55.69287,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Rundetårn &amp; Rosenborg Castle</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Combine tower, castle and King’s Garden on foot. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>12.57579,55.68136,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Islands Brygge harbour bath</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Bring a towel; read the notices on site if there are algae or jellyfish. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>12.57751,55.66852,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. CopenHill</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Take your bike via Nyhavn and the Opera House – a good route. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>12.6211,55.68487,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Reffen – street food by the water</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · The place is a bit remote – go by bike or harbour bus, at sunset. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>12.60897,55.69357,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Christiania</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Follow the signs on site, especially regarding photography. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>12.61045,55.67721,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Bakken</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>12.57526,55.7757,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>12. Day trip: Louisiana Museum &amp; Kronborg Castle</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Plan a full day by train. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/#o12</description><Point><coordinates>12.54316,55.96935,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>13. Smørrebrød, cinnamon buns &amp; pølser</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Try smørrebrød at lunch. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/#o13</description><Point><coordinates>12.5017,55.69251,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>14. Strøget &amp; Amagertorv</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come early in the morning for photos – the square is almost empty. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/copenhagen/#o14</description><Point><coordinates>12.5797,55.6788,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
